<title>UK: UBS hires head of bond credit research in Europe.</title>
<headline>UBS hires head of bond credit research in Europe.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Ltd said on Thursday it had hired Shira Cornwall as head of bond credit research for Europe.</p>
<p>Cornwall, previously head of bond credit research at BZW, was named in Institutional Investor magazine's 1996 All-Europe research team, UBS said in a statement.</p>
<p>Cornwall will be based in London and will report to Jim Durrant, global head of fixed income research. She joined BZW in 1988 and prior to that had worked on the gilts desk at Salomon Brothers, UBS said.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 6784</p>
